  - Root cause: The stub function had required keyword-only params (`keys`, `tie_group_map`, `num_groups`, `create_decode_wrapper`). Python checks the function signature and raises `TypeError` for missing required kwargs BEFORE entering the function body, so `warnings.warn` was never reached.
